nt will be deleted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project: Tomo Kihara, Playfool (Daniel Coppen, Saki Maruyama) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineering: Kye Shimizu, Daiki Hashimoto, Jasper Stephenson</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: Plot Generica </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logo: Yu Miyama</p>",
